Sponsor or CRO", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999983, 281.78398291015606, 555.5999999999999, 226.01497521784836]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 29, "section": "3.3 Safety Review Committee", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.0, 579.2639829101564, 555.24, 523.3749752178487]], "relevance": "high"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "embedding_ms": 276.01833301014267, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_search_ms": 225.1025839941576, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "hybrid_search": true, "cache_hit": true, "embedding_ms": 0.0, "db_search_ms": 537.8019580093678, "hybrid_parallel_ms": 731.4664579753298, "vector_count": 20, "bm25_count": 0, "fused_count": 20, "retrieval_total_ms": 731.6310000023805}, "original_chunk_count": 20, "compression_ms": 0.12787501327693462, "compressed_chunk_count": 16, "llm_call_ms": 32549.794542021118, "generation_total_ms": 34232.443334010895}}
2026-07-28 22:03:42,843 - rag_service.services.generation_service - INFO - {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "Can you be more specific?", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 14, "section": "Data Analyses"}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 15, "section": "Data Analyses"}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 29, "section": "3.3 Safety Review Committee"}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 38, "section": "4.4 Withdrawal Criteria"}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 16, "section": "Protocol No.: CTJ301UC201"}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 39, "section": "5.1 Treatments Administered"}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 43, "section": "6.1 Trial Flowchart"}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 40, "section": "5.3 Packaging and Labelling"}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 56, "section": "7.2 Trial-specific Blood and Faeces Sampling"}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 61, "section": "8.4 Pregnancy and Pregnancy Outcome"}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 70, "section": "Trial-specific Source Data Requirements"}], "context_char_count": 12451, "response": "## Key Specific Details from Protocol CTJ301UC201 (Ulcerative Colitis)\n\n### 1. Investigational Medicinal Product (IMP)\n- **Active substance:** TJ301, formulated at **15 mg/mL in solution for injection** (25 mM histidine, 200 mM sucrose, 0.1 mg/mL polysorbate 20) (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 39)\n- **Manufacturer:** Octoplus Development B.V. (now Dr. Reddy's Research & Development B.V.), Netherlands (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 39)\n- **Route of Administration:** Intravenous infusion over **2 hours** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 39)\n- **Concentrations used:**\n  - 300 mg group: **1.03 mg/mL TJ301**\n  - 600 mg group: **2.07 mg/mL TJ301**\n  - Placebo group: **0 mg/mL TJ301** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 39)\n- **Storage:** Both TJ301 and placebo stored at **-20 \u00b1 5\u00b0C** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 39)\n\n### 2. Trial Design\n- **Run-in Period** (if stable conventional treatment needed)\n- **4-week Screening Period**\n- **12-week double-blind Treatment Period**\n- **3-week Safety Follow-up Period** to Day 105 (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 43)\n\n### 3. Safety Review Committee (SRC)\n- Comprises at least **a medical monitor, a physician, and a pharmacologist** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 29)\n- Reviews **blinded data** and provides recommendations to the Sponsor (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 29)\n- A **SRC Working Procedure** must be signed **prior to enrolment of the first patient** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 29)\n\n### 4. Withdrawal Criteria\n- Discontinued patients are invited to a **Safety Follow-up Visit 35 days** after last IMP dose (**5.8\u20136.6 half-lives of TJ301**) (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 38)\n- **Withdrawn patients will not be replaced** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 38)\n- If withdrawal is due to an adverse event, the specific event must be recorded in the e-CRF (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 38)\n\n### 5. Pregnancy\n- If pregnancy occurs after informed consent, **IMP must be immediately stopped** and Sponsor informed immediately (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 61)\n- Follow-up required **until birth and one month after birth** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 61)\n- Abnormal pregnancy outcomes (e.g., birth defects) must be **reported as SAEs** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 61)\n\n### 6. Biomarker Sampling\n- Exploratory biomarkers include: **ESR, IL-6, IL-6/sIL-6R complex, neutrophil and platelet count** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 56)\n- Faecal **calprotectin** assessment also performed (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 56)\n\n### 7. Source Data Requirements\n- Minimum required records include: patient name, date of birth, screening/randomisation number, body weight/height, IMP dosing dates, AEs/SAEs, medical history, date of UC diagnosis, and concomitant therapies (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 70)", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 14, "section": "Data Analyses", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[70.77825164794922, 721.3942337036133, 552.4904174804688, 100.9449462890625], [70.77825164794922, 721.3942337036133, 552.4904174804688, 100.9449462890625], [70.77825164794922, 721.3942337036133, 552.4904174804688, 100.9449462890625], [70.77825164794922, 721.3942337036133, 552.4904174804688, 100.9449462890625]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 15, "section": "Data Analyses", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[70.58818054199219, 741.6407928466797, 552.329833984375, 101.82550048828125], [70.58818054199219, 741.6407928466797, 552.329833984375, 101.82550048828125], [70.58818054199219, 741.6407928466797, 552.329833984375, 101.82550048828125], [70.58818054199219, 741.6407928466797, 552.329833984375, 101.82550048828125], [70.58818054199219, 741.6407928466797, 552.329833984375, 101.82550048828125]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 29, "section": "3.3 Safety Review Committee", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.0, 579.2639829101564, 555.24, 523.3749752178487]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 38, "section": "4.4 Withdrawal Criteria", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999983, 522.9839829101561, 555.2399999999997, 467.0949752178484]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 16, "section": "Protocol No.: CTJ301UC201", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[70.82403564453125, 747.3405380249023, 551.7282104492188, 105.01318359375], [70.82403564453125, 747.3405380249023, 551.7282104492188, 105.01318359375]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 39, "section": "5.1 Treatments Administered", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999997, 689.9039829101564, 523.8, 664.4949752178487], [71.99999999999994, 459.52798291015654, 201.59999999999994, 448.9749752178488]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 43, "section": "6.1 Trial Flowchart", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999989, 689.9039829101564, 547.0799999999998, 588.5349752178487]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 40, "section": "5.3 Packaging and Labelling", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.0, 662.6639829101564, 532.92, 638.5749752178488]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 56, "section": "7.2 Trial-specific Blood and Faeces Sampling", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.0, 679.3439829101562, 547.596, 638.6949752178485]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 61, "section": "8.4 Pregnancy and Pregnancy Outcome", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.00000000000011, 173.54398291015616, 523.2, 148.13497521784848]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 70, "section": "Trial-specific Source Data Requirements", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.0, 441.62398291015637, 549.3600000000001, 355.4949752178486]], "relevance": "high"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "embedding_ms": 250.9755840001162, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_search_ms": 225.88962499867193, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "hybrid_search": true, "cache_hit": true, "embedding_ms": 0.0, "db_search_ms": 375.0784159929026, "hybrid_parallel_ms": 601.2651670025662, "vector_count": 20, "bm25_count": 12, "fused_count": 31, "retrieval_total_ms": 601.4250000007451}, "original_chunk_count": 20, "compression_ms": 0.10804200428538024, "compressed_chunk_count": 11, "llm_call_ms": 26610.760959010804, "generation_total_ms": 28125.194041000213}}
